29\nReason for Visit: Psoriasis / psoriatic arthritis\nBP: 132/80\nWeight: 101 lbs\n\nClinical Summary:\nOn May 29, 2023, Ms. Courtney Parker was seen by Dr. Adam Velazquez for management of her psoriasis and psoriatic arthritis. Blood pressure was recorded at 132/80 mmHg, and her weight was 101 pounds.\n\nPhysical Examination:\n- Skin: Psoriatic plaques were present but less severe than in previous years. There was mild erythema noted.\n- Musculoskeletal: There was no joint swelling or tenderness. Active range of motion was preserved.\n\nVitals:\n- Blood Pressure: 132/80 mmHg\n- Weight: 101 lbs\n\nAssessment:\nMs. Parker’s psoriasis and psori"
